OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters emotional after 9/11
OL,4,Amemorial race
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have said they were left
OL,7,Ffeeling emotional after they retraced
OL,8,Fthe 5km (3 mile) journey of a fireman
OL,9,Fwho died in the September 11 attacks in
OL,10,FNew York.
OL,12,FJamie Smith was among those from the
OL,13,FCounty Durham & Darlington Fire and
OL,14,FRescue Service (CDDFRS) who took part
OL,15,Fin the Tunnel to Towers 5K Run & Walk
OL,16,Fon Sunday.
OL,18,FThey, along with about 40,000 others,
OL,19,Fwalked from Brooklyn to the World Trade
OL,20,FCenter in New York, recreating the
OL,21,Ffinal journey of FDNY fireman, Stephen
OL,22,FSiller.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
