OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters emotional after 9/11
OL,4,Amemorial race
OL,5,
OL,6,FSmith, and a group of six serving
OL,7,Ffirefighters from the North East,
OL,8,Fcompleted the journey in full equipment
OL,9,Fin heavy rainfall in aid of charity.
